{"availability":"available","full":"ndarville/wishlist","name":"wishlist","description":"Easily make and host your own accessible wishlist for friends and family.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":11,"forks":2,"created":"2016-11-21T12:19:54Z","updated":"2024-04-15T19:01:06Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://ndarville.github.io/wishlist","topics":["github-pages","jekyll","self-hosted","static-site","wishlist"],"demo":"https://ndarville.github.io/wishlist","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:34.343Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:34.343Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:34.343Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T02:04:34.343Z","stars":11,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["It used to be that I could just press a button in my browser, and a link would be added to my Pinterest board of wishes. Now, Pinterest track their users across the Web, and you can’t give your friends and family a shareable link that doesn’t require them to register a user on Pinterest.","With Wishlist, you can create your own well-designed overview of your wishes with eminently readable text and mobile support. Independent on the whims, motives, and business models of other websites.","Of course, this is a wishlist mainly in name; if you want to create a list of charities or causes for people to support, you go right ahead and realize that project. In keeping with the spirit of these times, Wishlist also has built-in support for adding a list of charities people can donate to in your name in place of or in tandem with other regular wishes on your list."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ndarville/wishlist/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ba76587d41f1b12bf51e50edf2d584321dcce802a56b9746d7bab717306c0b12","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:34.464Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:34.464Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"It used to be that I could just press a